# Pull requests

- Propose the title and body, wait for confirmation, then create the pull request
- Target `develop` from work branches
- Write the title in Conventional Commits format, following the Commit messages section in `git`
- Write the body in Japanese
- Use `## Summary` and `## Test plan` sections in the body
- Use plain bullet points (`-`) in the Test plan, not checkboxes (`- [ ]`)
